{
  "_comment": [
    "QuakeQuest weapon wheel configuration.",
    "Each key is a mod name. It matches the -game directory, or the mission pack directory,",
    "or 'id1' for the base game. Type 'weaponwheel_reload' in the console to see the mod name",
    "the game is using and the weapons it found. The key 'default' covers every mod that has",
    "no entry of its own.",
    "",
    "Each weapon needs 4 fields:",
    "  name     the text shown when you point at the weapon",
    "  item     the inventory bit the weapon sets in STAT_ITEMS. Give a name from the list",
    "           below, or a plain number for a mod that uses its own bits.",
    "  impulse  the console impulse that selects the weapon",
    "  model    the model shown on the wheel. A missing model leaves the slot empty.",
    "",
    "Known item names: IT_AXE, IT_SHOTGUN, IT_SUPER_SHOTGUN, IT_NAILGUN, IT_SUPER_NAILGUN,",
    "IT_GRENADE_LAUNCHER, IT_ROCKET_LAUNCHER, IT_LIGHTNING, IT_SUPER_LIGHTNING,",
    "HIT_PROXIMITY_GUN, HIT_MJOLNIR, HIT_LASER_CANNON, RIT_AXE, RIT_LAVA_NAILGUN,",
    "RIT_LAVA_SUPER_NAILGUN, RIT_MULTI_GRENADE, RIT_MULTI_ROCKET, RIT_PLASMA_GUN.",
    "",
    "The order of the list is the order around the ring. The first weapon sits at the top.",
    "A maximum of 16 weapons fit on the wheel."
  ],

